sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller
    participant Label as OneTextLabel
    participant Registry as CanvasUpdateRegistry
    participant Engine as TextLayoutEngine
    participant Atlas as GlyphAtlas
    participant Flush as AtlasFlushScheduler
    participant Canvas

    Caller->>Label: Text = new string
    Label->>Label: CopyIntoSource, InvalidateText
    Note over Label: _parsedValid = false, _layoutGeneration++
    Label->>Registry: SetVerticesDirty, SetLayoutDirty
    Registry-->>Label: OnPopulateMesh(vh) during the canvas rebuild
    Label->>Label: PopulateMesh: EnsureNativeState (FontStack, atlas hold, material)
    Label->>Label: EnsureLayout: EnsureDisplayText (escapes, RichTextParser)
    Label->>Label: build LayoutKey and compare
    alt key differs
        Label->>Engine: Layout(_markup.TextSpan, BuildSettings, _layout)
        Engine-->>Label: lines, runs, glyphs, graphemes
        Label->>Label: _layoutRuns++, _quadsValid = false, DropVertexOverride
        Label->>Caller: OneTextEvents.RaiseTextChanged(label)
    end
    Label->>Label: RefreshPpemScale (screen density, hysteresis band)
    alt quads stale (layout generation or atlas version moved)
        Label->>Label: EmitBands(behind), per run: DensityFor, GlyphClusters.Split
        Label->>Atlas: PrepareClusters(font, density, positioned, clusters)
        Label->>Atlas: GetOrAddCluster per cluster
        Atlas-->>Label: AtlasLocation (UvRect, Layer, OriginUnits, SizeUnits)
        Label->>Label: _quads.Add(TextQuad), EmitBands(over), mark quads valid
    end
    Label->>Label: EmitQuads: reveal, TextAnimator, QuadModifier, tint, AddVert x4 per quad
    Label->>Flush: Request()
    Flush->>Canvas: registered at willRenderCanvases as ICanvasElement
    Canvas-->>Flush: Rebuild(CanvasUpdate.LatePreRender)
    Flush->>Atlas: Flush() uploads the Texture2DArray once for the frame
